# The two model concerns are deliberately UNCHECKED (see the Steepfile — their
# `included do` DSL bodies are unmodellable), so their modules aren't
# inline-declared anywhere. These declarations make the models'
# `include Discardable` / `include Roleable` resolve; the instance/class
# surface each concern provides is declared only as checked call sites demand
# (per-model class methods live in sig/discard.rbs / sig/model_singletons.rbs).
module Discardable
end

module Roleable
end
